        },
        {
          "text": "Kutuyö Apraam werïnyi Ismael nko monïng cho kikïyichï konyi cho kipö sekey nko monïng cho kyala ropïyenichi, kïmut chane lapay asis akonga kïrïp kegh nko kiyomisöto Tororöt. ",
